From 8d670b8b969bea020ae53c75c4326982bc86d973 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saturn <saturn@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:45:58 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] Saturn: start page, Saturn menu (Pinned list), empty
 favourites slot while dragging

- saturn://start: see-through start page (50% black) with a search box and
  the animated dot-art planet; shown at launch, for new tabs and when the
  last tab closes.
- saturn::ShowMenu(): blurred 196px menu with icons, dividers, disabled rows
  and submenus; used for the Pinned list (Copy Link, Rename Tab, Mute,
  Edit Pinned page, Duplicate, Move to, Remove Pin).
- Store: custom item names, editable item URLs, moving items between spaces.
- Dragging a tab shows the favourites' empty slot right away.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
